    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pfmk](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pfmk) Magnitude 6.0 earthquake at 36.0 depth occurred on Feb 23 2025 81km SE of Lata. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -11.2833 longitude 166.2672. It impacted 495 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
